<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- POGORO</book>
  <para style="h">WAEFESU</para>
  <para style="toc1">Luhamba lwa Paulu kwa Waefesu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Waefesu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Waef</para>
  <para style="mt2">LUHAMBA LWA PAULU KWA</para>
  <para style="mt1">WAEFESU</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOLERU</para>
  <para style="ip">Luhamba kwa Waefesu lulembitwi shaka shimu na luhamba kwa Wakolosayi, mushinja sha malongu sita Pakwiyuka Yesu. Mlemba gwa luhamba alu kalilanguziya mweni kuwera ndo ntumintumi Paulu (shipandi sha 1:1). Wabetula wavuwa wajimira kuwera Paulu ndo yakawalembiriti Waefesu ata maholu ga gweka ga Lamusiwu yagapatikana Muwakolosayi. Toziya ayi luhamba alu lufiruwitwi luzyengeti muvipinga vya wantu yawamjimira Yesu, walii yawaweriti mumkowa agu. Paulu viraa kuyowera kuwera palulembitwi luhamba alu, kaweriti mushibetubetu (shipandi sha 3:1-4:1). Paulu kamupananiti luhamba alu Tikiku yakaweriti Efesu su kalujegi kwa womberi (shipandi sha 6:21-22)</para>
  <para style="ip">Efesu luweriti lushi lukulu nentu na kwakuweriti liboma lya ukolamlima wa Warumi mukowa gwa Asiya ndidika. Efesu iweriti imanikana nentu kwa numba ya Mlungu mdala gwa Shiyunani yakashemitwi Atemi (Matendu 19:23-31). Shipinga sha wantu yawamjimira Yesu wa aku Efesu, shiyanjiti kwa makakala kumbiti shakapanu shiziti kuwera legilegi, (Ugubutulu shipandi sha 2:1-7).</para>
  <para style="ip">Mushipandi sha kwanja sha luhamba lwakuwi Paulu kalonga Mlungu ntambu yakawasyaguliti wantu wakuwi na kuwalopoziya kulawa muvidoda vyawu kupitira Yesu Kristu. Kashifaniziya shipinga sha wantu yawamjimira Yesu na nshimba ya Yesu na Yesu ndo mtuwi gwa nshimba ayi, kayi gambira numba na Yesu ndo kawera libuwi likulu lya pambwega. Na pahala pa shipandi sha pili sha luhamba lwakuwi Paulu kankulaviya malagaliru kwa makaliru ga wantu yawamjimira Yesu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yagaweramu</para>
  <para style="io">Paulu kankulilanguziya yomberi mweni na kuwalamusiya Waefesu, shipandi sha 1:1-2</para>
  <para style="io">Shakapanu kankushigambira shipinga sha waumini wa Mlungu kuwera pakwegera na Kristu, shipandi sha 1:3-3:21</para>
  <para style="io">Paulu kankulemba ntambu ya wantu yawamjimira Yesu na ntambu yawafiruwa kulikala, shipandi sha 4:1-6:20</para>
  <para style="io">Muupeleru Paulu kankuwapanani vitwatira vya kumalalira, shipandi sha 6:21-24</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Neni Paulu, kwa mafiliru ga Mlungu, wera ntumintumi gwa Yesu Kristu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:1">Nuwalembiriti mwenga wantu wa Mlungu yamulikala Efesu yamuwera waminika kwa kulikolerana pamuhera na Yesu Kristu.<verse eid="EPH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Manemu na ponga ga Tati gwetu Mlungu na Mtuwa gwetu Yesu Kristu gaweri pamuhera na mwenga.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matekeleru ga shirohu Mukristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Kakwiswi Mlungu Tati gwa Mtuwa gwetu Yesu Kristu! Toziya mukulikolerana pamuhera na Kristu yomberi katutekeleriti twenga kwa kutupanana matekeleru goseri ga shirohu ga kumpindi kwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Su pamberi pa kuumbwa pasipanu, Mlungu katusyaguliti kala twenga tuweri wakuwi kwa kulikolerana pamuhera na Kristu, su tuweri wananagala pota na kuwera shidoda kulongolu kwakuwi. Toziya ya mafiliru gakuwi, <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />Mlungu kalongiti kala kuwera kupitira Yesu Kristu katutenditi twenga tuweri wana wakuwi, hangu ndo ntambu yakafiriti na shashimuherepeziyiti. <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />Su twenga tumuzyumi Mlungu manemu gakuwi gana ukwisa, toziya yakatupanana hera Mwana gwakuwi yakamfira nentu!<verse eid="EPH 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Kwa mwazi gwakuwi Kristu, twenga twankulopoziwa na kulekiziwa vidoda vyatutenda. Ndo ntambu yauwera ukulu wa manemu ga Mlungu <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />gakatupananiti twenga kuvuwa!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:8">Muluhala lwakuwi na malifa gakuwi goseri <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />Mlungu katenditi shilii shakapangiti kutenda na katutenditi tugamani galii gagalififiti, gakafiriti kugatenda kupitira Kristu. <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />Aga hagatendeki mumashaka galii gakatuliti Mlungu pagasoka, guweriti gwakujojinira viwumbi vyoseri pamuhera, kila shintu kumpindi kwa Mlungu na pasipanu vilongoziwi na Kristu.<verse eid="EPH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Vintu vyoseri vitendeka ntambu yakafiriti Mlungu, yomberi katusyagula twenga tuweri wantu wakuwi kwa kulikolerana pamuhera na Kristu ntambu yakafiriti, kaamuwiti hangu kwanjira lupaga. <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />Su twenga yatulongoleriti kumtumbira Kristu, tufiruwa tuwuzyumi ukwisa wa Mlungu!<verse eid="EPH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Na mwenga viraa muwera wantu wa Mlungu, pampikaniriti unakaka wa ujumbi wa Shisoweru Shiwagira shashijegiti ulopoziya. Mwenga mumjimiriti Kristu na Mlungu kawatuliti shilangaliru kuwera wantu wakuwi kwa kuwapanana Rohu Mnanagala yakamlagiliti. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />Rohu Mnanagala ndo yakatutenda tuweri na unakaka kuwanka goseri Mlungu gakawalagiliti wantu wakuwi na shitwatira ashi shitulanguziya nakaka kuwera Mlungu hakawalekiziyi woseri yawawera wakuwi. Tuuzyumi ukwisa wakuwi!<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntambu Paulu pakawaluwiriti Waefesu kwa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Toziya ayi kwanjira pampikaniriti njimiru yenu kwa Mtuwa Yesu na mafiliru genu kwa wantu wa Mlungu, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />ndekiti ndiri kumgambira Mlungu mayagashii toziya ya mwenga. Panumluwa Mlungu nuwalyaluwa ndiri, <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />su numuluwa Tati yakawera na ukwisa, Mlungu gwa Mtuwa gwetu Yesu Kristu, kawapanani Rohu gwakuwi yakawatenda mwenga muweri na luhala na kuwagubutulireni Mlungu, su mwenga hamummani nentu. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Numuluwa Mlungu kawatangi mwenga mpati kulimana litumbiru lilii lyakawashemerani na ukwisa mkulu wa lifupu lya uhala lyakawatuliliti wantu wakuwi, <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />mpati kuumana uwezu wakuwi ntambu yawuwera mkulu nentu toziya ya twenga yatujimira. Uwezu awu wawutenda lihengu mngati mwa twenga, ulifana na makakala galii makulu nentu <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />gakamzyukisiyiti Kristu na kamkalasiya pahala pa ukolamlima kumpindi. <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />Aku Kristu kawera mkulu gwa wakulu, kankukolamlima mukila kolamlima na wanauwezu na makakala na watuwa, kankukolamlima kila rohu yayitumbirwa mupasipanu na pasipanu payiza. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Mlungu kamupananiti Yesu uwezu wa vintu vyoseri na kumtula kuwera mtuwi gwa vintu vyoseri mushipinga sha wantu yawamjimira Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />Shipinga sha wantu shawamjimira Mlungu ndo nshimba ya Kristu. Shipinga sha wantu shawamjimira Mlungu shimemiziwa na Kristu na Kristu kamemiziya kila shintu pahala poseri.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s">Kulawa mukuhowa na kwingira muwukomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Pamakashu mwenga muweriti gambira muhowa toziya ya vidoda vyamtenditi. <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />Mushaka shilii mwenga mulikaliti kugendera njira zya vidoda vya wantu wa pasipanu ntambu yaviwera, mwenga mjimiliti ukolamlima wa washamshera yawawera na makakala wa kulyera. Washamshera yawawatenda vinu wantu waleki kumjimira Mlungu. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Ntambu yatuwera, twoseri twenga tuweriti gambira womberi na tulikaliti kulawirana na lumatamata lwatwenga lya pasipanu na kutenda hera vitwatira vyaviherepeziyiti nshimba na mahala getu. Twenga tulifaniti na womberi, su tufiriwitwi tutabisiwi na maya ga Mlungu.<verse eid="EPH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Kumbiti Mlungu ndo kana lusungu nentu. Katufiriti kwa mafiliru gakuwi makulu kwa twenga, <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />ata patuweriti tuhowa toziya ya vidoda, yomberi katutenditi tuweri wakomu pamuhera na Kristu. Kwa manemu ga Mlungu, mwenga mlopoziwitwi. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Kwa kulikolerana pamuhera na Yesu Kristu, Mlungu katuzyukusiyiti pamuhera na yomberi, su tukalikali pamuhera na Yesu kumpindi kwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />Ndo ntambu yakafiriti kulanguziya kwa shaka shashiza, ukulu wa manemu gakuwi kwa mafiliru gakatulanguziyiti twenga kupitira Yesu Kristu. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Toziya kwa manemu ga Mlungu, mwenga mlopoziwa kupitira njimiru. Shitwatira ashi shilawa ndiri kwa maweni mwenga, kumbiti shilawa kwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />Su muntu yoseri nakalitumbira toziya kagutenderiti ndiri lihengu. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Twenga twa viwumbi vya Mlungu na kwa kulikolerana pamuhera na Kristu Yesu, yomberi kawumbiti toziya kulikala makaliru ga matendu maheri gakatutandiriti kala tugatendi.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vipinga viwili kuwera shipinga shimu Mukristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Muholi ntambu yamuweriti pamakashu, mwenga kwa kwiwuka muwera wantu yawawera ndiri Wayawudi, mwenga yamshemwa “Wantu yawayingiziwitwi ndiri jandu” na Wayawudi walishema weni, “Wantu yawayingiziwa jandu,” Toziya ya shilii shashitendwa munshimba zyawu kwa mawoku ga wantu kulanguziya weni ndo wantu wa Mlungu. <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Muliholi vilaa shaka shilii mwenga muweriti mulikolerana ndiri pamuhera na Kristu, mwenga mubagulitwi na wantu wa Israeli na muweriti wahenga kwa mapatanu yagaweriti na lagilu ya Mlungu. Mulikaliti pasipanu, uganu muweriti gambira wantu yawahera litumbiru, walii yawammana ndiri Mlungu. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Pamakashu mwenga muweriti kutali na Mlungu, kumbiti vinu kwa kulikolerana pamuhera na Kristu Yesu, mwenga mjegitwi pakwegera kupitira mwazi gwa Kristu. <verse eid="EPH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Toziya Kristu mweni katujegeriti ponga kwa kuwatenda Wayawudi na wantu yawawera ndiri Wayawudi kuwera wantu umu. Kwa kuyilaviya nshimba yakuwi mweni kuwera tambiku kabomoliti ungondu wawu yawuweriti gambira shibambaza shashiwalekaniziyiti. <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />Kagaharabisiyiti nakamu Malagaliru ga Wayawudi pamuhera na lagiru lyakuwi na genderanu yakuwi, su kulawira vipinga viwili, yomberi katenda shipinga shimu sha wantu wasyayi mukulikolerana pamuhera na mweni, kwa njira ayi katenditi ponga. <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />Kupitira kuyilaviya nshimba yakuwi palupingika kuwera tambiku, Kristu kawuhalabisiyiti ungondu wawu na katenditi vipinga viwili viweri gambira nshimba yimu na kuwakolaniziya pamuhera na Mlungu.<verse eid="EPH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Su Kristu kiziti kushibwera Shisoweru Shiwagira sha ponga kwa wantu woseri, mwenga wantu yamuwera ndiri Wayawudi, yamuweriti kutali na Mlungu na kwa Wayawudi yawawera pakwegera na Mlungu. <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Su kupitira Kristu, twawoseri twenga Wayawudi na wantu yawawera ndiri Wayawudi tupata lupenyu kumgendera Tati kwa Rohu yumu.<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Su mwenga mwawahenga ndiri kayi, ama wantu wa kunja ndiri, mwenga vinu muwera wenikaya pamuhera na wantu wa Mlungu, muwera wantu wa kaya ya Mlungu. <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />Mwenga viraa mnyawa mulyanjiru lyalitulitwi na wantumintumi pamuhera na wambuyi wa Mlungu na Kristu Yesu mweni ndo litalawu likulu lyaliwera na mana nentu. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Yomberi ndo mweni yakayikolera numba yoseri na kuyikuliziya iweri Numba nkulu nanagala ya Mlungu toziya ya Mtuwa. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Kwa kulikolerana pamuhera na Kristu, mwenga viraa mnyawa pamuhera na wamonga woseri, muweri pahala Mlungu kalikala kupitira Rohu gwakuwi.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s">Lihengu lya Paulu kwa wantu yawawera ndiri Wayawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Su neni Paulu, nwera mushibetubetu toziya numtendera Yesu Kristu kwajili ya mwenga wantu yamuwera ndiri Wayawudi, numuluwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />Nakaka mwenga mupikanira kuwera Mlungu kwa manemu gakuwi, kampananiti neni lihengu ali nulitendi kwa mbotu ya mwenga. <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />Mlungu kangubutuliti nuyimani bada ayi. Nongiti kwa ufupi hera muluhamba alu kuusu shitwatila ashi, <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />mwenga pamvibetula visoweru vyaneni hamuwezi kuvimana ntambu yanuvimana bada ayi ya Kristu. <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />Makashu wantu Wagambilitwi ndiri bada ayi, kumbiti vinu Mlungu kawagubutuliti kupitira Rohu gwakuwi kwa wantumintumi wananagala wakuwi na wambuyi wakuwi. <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Bada yeni ndo ayi, kwa njira ya Shisoweru Shiwagira wantu yawawera ndiri Wayawudi wawanka matekeleru ga Mlungu pamuhera na Wayawudi, woseri awa wawera wantu wa nshimba yimu na kwa pamuhera woseri wankuwanka lagilu lyakalitakuliti Mlungu kupitira Kristu Yesu.<verse eid="EPH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Neni wantenda kuwera ntumintumi gwa Shisoweru Shiwagira kwa manemu ga gweka gakampananiti Mlungu, kwa uwezu wakuwi mkulu. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Neni namdidika kuliku wantu woseri wa Mlungu, kumbiti kampananiti manemu gakuwi su nuwabweleri wantu yawawera ndiri Wayawudi, Shisoweru Shiwagira sha ulunda wakuwi Kristu, yawupimika ndiri, <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />na kutenda wantu wavimani mpangu wa bada ya Mlungu yayififikiti ntambu yayitenda lihengu. Mlungu yakaumbiti vintu vyoseri, kayififiti bada yakuwi kwanjira lupaga lwa pasipanu. <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />Su vinu kwa njira ya shipinga sha wantu yawamjimira Yesu, wakulu na yawawera na makakala kumpindi kwa Mlungu wapati kulumana luhala ntambu Mlungu yakana luhala muvitwatira vyoseri.<verse eid="EPH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Mlungu kashitenditi shitwatila ashi kugenderana na mafiliru gakuwi ga mashaka goseri, aga kagatenditi kupitira Yesu Kristu Mtuwa gwetu. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Su mukulikolera pamuhera na Kristu na kwa kumjimira Yomberi, twenga tupata lupenyu patuwera na unakaka tumgendera Mlungu kwa matumbiru. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Su nankuwaluweni namuwuya kumbeli toziya ya ntabika yampata toziya ya mwenga, ntenda hangu toziya ya ukwisa wa mwenga.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafiliru ga Kristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Toziya ayi numsuntamalira Tati kumluwa, <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />yakawera shanjiru sha kaya zyoseri pasipanu na kumpindi. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />Numuluwa Mlungu kulawirana na ukwisa wakuwi mkulu, kawapanani mwenga makakala kupitira Rohu gwakuwi muweri wagangamala mngati mwa mwenga, <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />su nankuluwa kuwera Kristu kalikali mumyoyu ya mwenga kupitira njimiru. Numuluwa Mlungu mpati kuwera na mishigira na lyanjiru lya mafiliru, <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />su muwezi kuvimana pamuhera na wantu woseri wa Mlungu ntambu mafiliru ga Kristu gaeneya kwa utali na upana kwa kimu na kina. <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />Yina, mpati kumana mafiliru ga Kristu gagapita mahala goseri, mmemiziwi nakamu visoweru vyakuwi vyoseri vya Mlungu.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Mlungu kaweza kutenda vitwatira vikulu nentu kuliku vilii vyatuweza kuviluwa ama kuvihola, kwa makakala gakuwi gagatenda lihengu mngati mwa twenga, <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />Mlungu kakwisuwi kupitira shipinga sha wantu woseri yawamjimira Yesu na kupitira Kristu Yesu mweni, kakwisuwi, viyiwuku vyoseri na mashaka goseri! Yina haa.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s">Kulikolerana munshimba ya Kristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Su, neni yanwera mtatilwa toziya numtendera Mtuwa, nuwaluwa mulikali makaliru yagafiruwa shemwa yamshemeritwi. <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />Mashaka goseri muweri wananagala, wapoli na wantu wa kuhepelera, muliheperani mwenga kwa mwenga kwa mafiliru. <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Mgangamali kutula weri wumu wawujegwa na Rohu kwa kutenda ponga yayiwera pakati penu. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Kwana nshimba yimu ya Kristu na Rohu yumu ntambu litumbiru lyamshemelitwi na Mlungu ndo limu. <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Kwana Mtuwa yumu na njimiru yimu na ubatizu wumu, <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />kwana Mlungu yumu ndo Tati gwa woseri, ndomweni Mtuwa gwa woseri yakatenda lihengu muvyoseri na kamuwoseri.<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Na kila yumu gwetu kawankiti manemu ga lifupu ntambu ya shipimu shakapatiti kwa Kristu. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Malembu ntambu yagalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">“Pakanyasukiti kugenda kumpindi nentu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">Kawalonguziyiti walopolwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">Vilaa kawapananiti wantu mafupu.”<verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />Vinu patulonga, “Kanyasukiti kugenda kumpindi” Kwana mana gaa? Mana yakuwi hangu, kasulukiti mpaka pasi nakamu pasipanu. <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Su ulii yakasulukiti pasipanu ndo ayu yakanyasukiti kugenda kumpindi kwa mpindi zyoseri su kavikamilishi vintu vyoseri.<verse eid="EPH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Ndo mweni kawatenda wantu wamonga waweri wantumintumi na wamonga waweri wambuyi wa Mlungu na wamonga waweri wantu wa kushibwera Shisoweru Shiwagira na wamonga waweri walolera pamuhera na wafunda. <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />Katenditi hangu kapati kuwatandira wantu woseri wa Mlungu toziya ya lihengu lya utendera Washikritu su kuyinyawa nshimba ya Kristu, <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />na hangu twoseri tuwufikiri uwumu munjimiru na kummana Mwana gwa Mlungu, pamuhera tuweri yawakula, kufikira ukamilika wakuwi Kristu mweni.<verse eid="EPH 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Su hapeni tuweri kayi gambira wana, patwaswa na kugulusiwa aku na aku kwa kila liyega lya mafundu ga kuwapayira wantu, su wawahowiziyi wamonga. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Handa patuyowera unakaka kwa moyu gwa mafiliru, twenga hatukuli mukila shitwatira kulinganira na Kristu ndo mtuwi gwa wantu yawajimira. <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />Pasi pa ulongoziwu wakuwi, viwungiru vyoseri vya nshimba vilikolerana pamuhera na nshimba yoseri ilitumbira kwa viwungiru vyakuwi. Su kila shiwungiru pashitenda lihengu lyakuwi ntambu yayifiruwa, nshimba yoseri ikula na kulinyawa mumafiliru.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makaliru ga syayi Muwukristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Su kwa litawu lya Mtuwa, nankuwabereziya, namulikala kayi gambira wantu yawammana ndiri Mlungu, ndoweni maholu gawu gahera mahala, <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />na mahala gawu gawera muluwindu. Wakutali na ukomu yawulawa kwa Mlungu toziya ya uzigizigi yawuwera mngati mwawu na ukalipa wawu. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Wapotoka na wahera soni, waliyingiziya muwupayira, womberi watenda kwa lopulopu kila ntambu ya vitwatira vya soni.<verse eid="EPH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Kumbiti mwenga mlifunda hangu ndiri kuusu Kristu. <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />Hashi, mwenga mupikanira ndiri kuusu Yesu? Nakaka mwenga mfunditwi kuusu yomberi kuwera unakaka wamungati mwakuwi. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Su, mleki mgenderanu gwenu gwa kwanja ntambu muntu yakavula nguwu yakuwi, yani umuntu wenu mgona wawuweriti wankuharibisiwa kwa matamata zyakuwi mpayikiru. <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />Mnyawi syayi ya murohu na mmaholu genu. <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />Mvali ntambu ya syayi ya umuntu gambira muntu yakavala nguwu ndoyeni yiumbwa kwa mfanu gwa Mlungu na ndoyeni ililanguziya mumakaliru ga nakaka ga kumfiriziya Mlungu na unanagala.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Hangu, mleki mpayu, kila yumu kafiruwa kumgambira mlongu myaguwi unakaka toziya kila yumu gwetu kashiwungiru sha nshimba ya Kristu. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />Handa pamkalala, namjumira maya genu gawatendi mtendi vidoda na namulikala na maya mpaka paguzyeta mshenji. <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />Namumpa Shetani lupenyu,<verse eid="EPH 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Yakaweriti kankwiwa, nakiwa kayi, kumbiti kanji kutenda lihengu liheri kwa mawoku gakuwi kapati kuwera na shintu sha kulitanga mweni na kumtanga muntu muhushu. <verse eid="EPH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Visoweru vidoda navipikinika nakamu pakati penu, kila mala visoweru vyenu viweri viherepa na vyeni vinyawa na kuwatanga wamonga, su viwanemeziyi wantu wenu yawapikinira.<verse eid="EPH 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Namumuhinginiziya Rohu Mnanagala gwa Mlungu toziya Rohu ayu ndo shilanguliru sha Mlungu kwa mwenga kuwera mwenga mwawantu wakuwi na shilanguziwu kuwera lishaka liza ndopeni Mlungu hakawalekiziyi. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Su, mlekani kulikalalirana shuki na mleki maya na mleki umatu na mleki kwigilanga na mleki kila ukondola! <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Muweri na moyu muheri kwa kila yumu gwenu na muweri na lusungu na kila yumu kamlekiziyi myaguwi handa Mlungu ntambu yakawalekiziya mwenga kwa njira ya Kristu.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="s">Kulikala muwulangala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Su mtendi gambira Mlungu mukila shintu shamtenda, toziya mwenga mwawana wakuwi wamfiruwa. <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />Nfiru ilonguziyi makaliru genu handa Kristu ntambu yakatufira na kwajili ya twenga kalilaviya mweni handa tambiku ya utuli ununkira na shijungu shashimfiriziya Mlungu.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Toziya mwenga mwawantu wa Mlungu, uhumba na uhakata woseri ama shapa navikandwa nakamu kwamwenga. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Kayi visoweru vya soni na visoweru vya upuwuzi ama lidufiya na vyoseri avi viherepa ndiri kwa mwenga, ama visoweru vya kulonga mayagashii Mlungu ndo viherepa. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Muvimani pota na kufifa handa muhumba yoseri ama mdoda ama mpyotera na upyotera ndo sawa na kuguwira shinyagu, ama muntu yoseri kantambu ayi hapeni kapati shoseri Muufalumi wa Kristu na Mlungu.<verse eid="EPH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Namumjumira muntu yoseri kawapayili kwa visoweru hera, toziya ya vitwatira gambira avi, maya ga Mlungu gawizira woseri yawamjimira ndiri, <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Su, namtenda pamuhera na womberi.<verse eid="EPH 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Makashu mwenga muweriti mluwindu na vinu muwera muwulangala kwa kulikolerana pamuhera na Mtuwa. Mulikali gambira wana wa ulangala. <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />Mana malawiru ga ulangala ndo uherepa yawukamilika na uheri na unakaka. <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Mjeri kuvimana galii yagamfiriziya Mtuwa <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Namtenda vitendu vyaviherepa ndiri vya luwindu, kumbiti muvilaviyi paweru. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Vitwatira vyavitendwa kwa bada, soni ata kuvikanda. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Kumbiti vitwatira vilii vyavitendwa muwulangala, unakaka wakuwi ulanguziwa, <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />na kila shashilanguziwa shiwera ulangala. Ndo mana Malembu Mananagala galonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">“Gwimuki gwenga gwagugonja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">Guzyuki kulawa kwa yawahowiti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">Na Kristu hakakulangaliri.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Su muliloli hweri ntambu yamulikala. Namulikala gambira wantu yawahera mahala, kumbiti mulikali gambira wantu yawawera na luhala. <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />Mulutenderi hweri lupenyu lwamuwera nalu toziya mashaka aga gadoda. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Su namuwera wazigizigi, kumbiti mjeri kuvimana galii gakafira Mtuwa.<verse eid="EPH 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Mleki kulowera toziya hakawatendi msindi kulilewelera kutenda vitwatira pota na kuholera malawiru gakuwi, kumbiti mwenga mmemiziwi Rohu Mnanagala. <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />Muyoweri kwa visoweru vya zaburi na lwimbu na tenzi za shirohu, mmumwimbiri Mtuwa lwimbu na zaburi kwa mayagashii mumyoyu mwa mwenga. <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />Mumgambiri mayagashii Mlungu Tati kupitira Mtuwa gwetu Yesu Kristu kwa kila lishaka na kila shintu.<verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wadala na wapalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Kila yumu kammani myaguwi toziya ya kumguwira Kristu. <verse eid="EPH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Wadala wawamani wapalu wawu handa kummana Mtuwa. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Toziya mpalu kanawu ukolamlima kwa mdala gwakuwi gambira Kristu ntambu yakawera na ukolamlima kwa shipinga wantu woseri yawamjimira Yesu na Kristu mweni kawaponiziya wantu yawamjimira, womberi ndo nshimba yakuwi. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Handa shipinga sha wantu yawamjimira Yesu, ntambu yawammana Kristu ntambu iraa ayi wadala wawamani wapalu wawu muvitwatira vyoseri.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Na mwenga wapalu, muwafiri wadala wenu handa Kristu ntambu yakashifiriti shipinga shakuwi, kaliraviya mweni kwajili yawu. <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />Kawatenditi waweri wananagala kwa kuwagulula kwa mashi na shisoweru. <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />Su katenditi hangu kuwajojinira wantu woseri yawamjimira mweni, yawawera wananagala na wahera ukondola gambira mdala gwa ndowa pakajegwa kwa mpalu gwa ndowa, kawera kaherepa nentu na kahera lidowa ama shidoda shoseri. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Wapalu wafiruwa kuwafira wadala wawu handa nshimba zyawu weni. Yomberi yakamfira mdala gwakuwi, kalifira mweni. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Kwahera muntu yoseri yakayilema nshimba yakuwi mweni, kumbiti kakuliyiziya na kuyivalasiya gambira Kristu ntambu yakashilolera shipinga sha wantu yawamjimira. <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />Toziya twenga twa viwungiru vya nshimba yakuwi. <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />Ntambu Malembu Mananagala ntambu yagalonga, “Toziya ayi, mpalu hakamleki tati na mawu gwakuwi, hakaweri pamuhera na mdala gwakuwi na womberi wawili hawaweri shintu shimu.” <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Kwana unakaka yawufifikiti muvisoweru avi, naneni mona handa vimuwusu Kristu na shipinga shakuwi <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Kumbiti gawawusu mwenga viraa, kila mpalu mpaka kamfiri mdala handa ntambu yakalifira mweni na mdala kafiruwa kamsheri mpalu gwakuwi.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s">Wana na walera wawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Mwawana mwenga, muwamani walera wenu toziya mwenga mulikolerana pamuhera na Mtuwa, ashi shitwatira shiherepa kushitenda. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />Malembu Mananagala galonga, “Muwagohiliri tati gwaku na mawu gwaku.” Ali ndo lagaliru lya kwanja lyaliwera na lagilu. <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />Lagilu ayi ndo kuwera hagupati mapatiru na kulikala vinja vivuwa pasipanu.<verse eid="EPH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Na watati mwenga, namwasoziya wana wenu kumbiti muwaleri munjira ya Mtuwa kwa kuwalanguziya mgenderanu guherepa na kuwafunda.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wamanda na watuwa wawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Mwawamanda mwenga, muwamani watuwa wenu pasipanu kwa lyoga na kulendemera, mtendi avi kwa moyu guherepa handa mwankumtendera Kristu, <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />Mtendi hangu hera ndiri pawawalola su mulifiliziyi kwa womberi, ira mtenderi kwa moyu ntambu yakafira Mlungu toziya mwenga ndo wantumintumi wa Kristu. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Handa pamtenda lihengu, mtendi lihengu lyenu kwa kunemelera handa kwa kumtendera ndiri muntu kumbiti mumtendera Mtuwa. <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />Muliholi kuwera kila muntu yakatenda gaherepa kaweri mmanda ama muntu mlekeziwa, hakawanki lifupu lyakuwi kulawa kwa Mtuwa.<verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Na mwenga yamtenderwa, muwatenderi ntambu iraayi wamanda wenu na mleki kutenda vitiriziwu. Mliholi handa mwenga viraa gambira womberi viraa mwanayu Mtuwa ulaulii kumpindi na yomberi katenda kwa kubagula.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngondu za shirohu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Upeleru wakuwi, nuwafilirani muweri wagangamala mukulikolerana pamuhera na Mtuwa na kwa makakala gakuwi makulu. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Mtoli ndiwiru zyoseri zya ngondu zyakawapananiti Mlungu mpati kuzilema ngolukeru zidoda zya Shetani. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Ngondu zyetu, ndo ngondu ndiri pakati petu na wantu, kumbiti ngondu zyatulikoma, tulikoma na washamshera yawakolamlima mupasipanu pa shirohu na muluwindu lwa vidoda pasipanu. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Toziya ayi, mtoli ndiwiru zya Mlungu su lishaka lilii palisoka mwezi kugalema makomangu ga wankondu na pamulikomanga kala mpaka upeleru, hamuweri mwankali wagangamala.<verse eid="EPH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Su muweri kala, unakaka uweri gambira mkanda mushunu mwenu, kumfiriziya Mlungu kuweri gambira nguwu ya shuma ya kudiwa mushifuwa, <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />Na lumatamata lwa kushibwera Shisoweru Shiwagira sha ponga shiweri gambira vilwatu mumagulu mwenu. <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Nentu ga goseri aga njimiru iweri gambira mbingiru mumawoku mwenu mashaka goseri, muiwezeshi kuyidiwira misali ya motu ya mu Shetani. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Muwanki ulopoziwu gambira kofiya yamwenga ya shuma na shisoweru shakatakuliti Mlungu gambira ligumba lwampananitwi na Rohu Mnanagala. <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Mluwi majuwa goseri, pamluwa Mlungu kawatangi, mluwi kila shaka kwa likakala lya Rohu. Mukali masu pota na kutoka pamluwa kwajili ya wantu woseri wa Mlungu. <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />Munduwiri na neni viraa su pantakula, Mlungu kawezeshi neni kutakula pota na kufifa kuwagambira wantu lifumbu lya shisoweru shiwagira kwa ukamilifu. <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />Neni namjumbi gwa shisoweru shiwagira ashi tembera vinu namushibetubetu, muluwi Mlungu, su nwezi kuwera mgangamala mukubwera ntambu yayifiruwa.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lamusiwu lya upeleru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Tukiku, mlongu gwetu yatumfira na ntumintumi yakaaminika mukulikolerana pamuhera na Mtuwa, hakawapanani visoweru vyangu vyoseri mpati kuvimana shantenda. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Numtumiti kwa mwenga kuwagambirani visoweru vyetu mpati kuwera na moyu.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Mlungu Tati na Mtuwa Yesu Kristu kawapanani Wakristu woseri ponga na mafiliru na njimiru. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Manemu ga Mlungu gaweri kwa woseri yawamfira Mtuwa gwetu Yesu Kristu kwa mafiliru yagahera upeleru.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>